1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,780
Resist. You have to resist!

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,180
Can you see it?

3
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,400
No.

4
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,550
The oppressed actor
must resist now.

5
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:07,200
No.

6
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,350
Listen to the director.
Fight back, now.

7
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,350
Did you not see it?

8
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:12,180
No.

9
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:13,500
No.

10
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,660
Look.

11
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:17,200
Do not resist. Look.

12
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:20,860
Can you see it?
Do you see it?

13
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:23,910
Eyes? What eyes?

14
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,660
What do you want me to see?

15
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:28,620
I see nothing.

16
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,560
Look.
